    mc "(Eu poderia me oferecer para ajudá-la, mas [mc_vic_address] atribuiu [a_name] este trabalho)."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:537
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_46d0311e:

#   mc "(Maybe I should wait until she asks me to help her.)"
    mc "(Talvez eu deva esperar até que ela me peça ajuda.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:543
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_07342177:

#   mc "(If [mc_vic_address] finds out that I helped [a_name] and we succeed in our mission, then that can only be a good thing for both of us.)"
    mc "(Se [mc_vic_address] descobre que eu ajudei [a_name] E se tivermos sucesso em nossa missão, isso só poderá ser bom para nós dois."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:544
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_eba84ade:

#   mc "(Plus I kind of owe her for offering to help me try and get the drive back.)"
    mc "(Além disso, de certa forma, devo a ela por se oferecer para me ajudar a tentar recuperar o carro.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:547
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_b09ed0a1:

#   mc "Well, what if I go with you?"
    mc "E se eu for com você?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:549
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_f7b67539:

#   a "Really? You’d help me?"
    a "Sério? Você me ajudaria?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:551
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_4458603a:

#   mc "Yeah, sure I will. You'll need someone to help you get in and out without getting caught."
    mc "Sim, claro que sim. Você vai precisar de alguém para te ajudar a entrar e sair sem ser pego."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:554
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_235845f7:

#   mc "And also someone to be a distraction so you can do your thing."
    mc "E também alguém para te distrair enquanto você faz suas coisas."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:555
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_6d5f92d0:

#   mc "So how about it?"
    mc "E aí, o que acha?"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:557
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_3998e36f:

#   a "Thanks, [y_name]. That’d be great!"
    a "Obrigado, [y_name] Isso seria ótimo!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:572
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_316ee2ab:

#   a "Oh, finally!"
    a "Ah, finalmente!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:585
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_aa9035dc:

#   a "I was about to give up on this darn thing!"
    a "Eu estava quase desistindo dessa coisa maldita!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:586
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_9732b5de:

#   mc "Give up? That’s not in your nature."
    mc "Desistir? Isso não está na sua natureza."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:587
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_63d8c9fe:

#   mc "You always figure these things out, [a_name]."
    mc "Você sempre dá um jeito nessas coisas, [a_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:592
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_691744cb:

#   a "Oh!!"
    a "Oh!!"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:595
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_d17819fe:

#   mc "(Well, well... I wasn’t expecting something like this on her work computer.)"
    mc "(Bem, bem... eu não esperava algo assim no computador de trabalho dela.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:596
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_6a1c7dc3:

#   mc "(It’s pretty funny though.)"
    mc "(Mas é bem engraçado.)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:599
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_59c83bac:

#   a "Um... That’s not mine. I swear."
    a "Hum... Isso não é meu. Juro."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:602
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_5d25f7fd:

#   mc "(I get the impression those two dimwits out front are playing a practical joke on her.)"
    mc "Tenho a impressão de que aqueles dois idiotas lá na frente estão pregando uma peça nela."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:603
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_57b6772f:

#   mc "Hey, don’t worry about it."
    mc "Ei, não se preocupe com isso."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:604
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_e4088c22:

#   mc "I met your co-workers so this doesn't surprise to me at all."
    mc "Conheci seus colegas de trabalho, então isso não me surpreende em nada."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:606
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_d849f5c7:

#   a "Oh..."
    a "Oh..."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:608
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_9d4a93ea:

#   mc "However, I’d change it as soon as you can."
    mc "No entanto, eu mudaria isso assim que possível."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:610
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_59b9ebe8:

#   mc "Just in case your boss sees it and thinks that you’re responsible."
    mc "Só para o caso de seu chefe ver isso e pensar que você é o responsável."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:612
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_201c03ca:

#   a "Yeah, I’ll do that shortly."
    a "Sim, farei isso em breve."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:614
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_6aa79816:

#   a "I'll just hide it for now."
    a "Vou esconder isso por enquanto."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:616
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_07b2abaf:

#   mc "Anyway... I’ll let you get back to work."
    mc "Enfim... vou deixar você voltar ao trabalho."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:617
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_30317567:

#   mc "See you at home, [a_name]."
    mc "Te vejo em casa, [a_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:619
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_563a8ba7:

#   a "Bye, [a_mc_address]."
    a "Tchau, [a_mc_address]."

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:626
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_4304868c:

#   mc "(Ah geez... How the hell is that girl still here?)"
    mc "(Ah, puxa... Como é que aquela garota ainda está aqui?)"

# game/scripts/Episode 01/Day 2/05_01_The_MC_Visits_Ariel_at_Work.rpy:627
translate brazil lb_ep01_05_01_Ariel_Work_4_8234759d:

#   mc "(Man, I'd hate to be in that line...)"
    mc "(Cara, eu detestaria estar nessa fila...)"

